msgid "Topping Rules"
msgstr "Reglas de ingredientes"

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:370
msgid ""
"Set the maximum number of toppings a customer can add. Set to 0 for "
"unlimited. This helps you control the ordering experience and match how your "
"kitchen actually works."
msgstr ""

