#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:388
msgid ""
"Control how the pizza visualizer looks — its maximum size on screen, whether "
"it's round or square, and its border/accent colors. This is purely visual "
"and doesn't affect ordering. Pick whatever looks best on your website."
msgstr ""

