#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:394
msgid ""
"The maximum width of the pizza visualizer. 600px is a good default for most "
"layouts. The pizza will still scale down on smaller screens."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:404
msgid ""
"Round (circle) looks like a real pizza. Square works well for pan/Detroit-"
"style pizzas. Rectangle is good for sheet pizzas. Custom lets you set your "
"own aspect ratio and radius."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:407 blocks/pizza-builder/block.js:27
msgid "Round (circle)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:408
msgid "Square"
