msgid "Hide Tabs With No Items"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:477
msgid ""
"If you haven't added any drizzles yet, should the \"Drizzle\" tab be hidden? "
"Turn this on to keep the builder tidy — tabs only appear once you've added "
"content for them."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:479
msgid "Hide tabs that have no published items"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:484
msgid "Step-by-Step Mode"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:485
msgid ""
"Locks customers to one tab at a time, stepping through crust → sauce → "
"cheese → toppings in order. Great for guided ordering workflows."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:487
msgid "Guide customers through tabs one step at a time"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:493
msgid "Text & Messaging"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:495
msgid ""
"Customise the words customers see inside the builder — the tagline shown in "
"the header and an optional demo/notice banner. This is your chance to give "
"the experience your restaurant's voice and personality."
msgstr ""

