msgid "Builder Tagline"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:501
msgid ""
"A short tagline shown in the builder header — something like \"Build Your "
"Perfect Pizza\" or \"Create Your Masterpiece\". Leave blank to hide it."
