msgid ""
"An optional notice shown above the builder — useful for \"This is a demo\" "
"messages, promotions, or reminders like \"Delivery orders close at 9 PM\". "
"Leave blank to hide it."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:511
msgid "Leave blank to hide"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:520
msgid ""
"Fine-tune the little extras that make the ordering experience smooth and "
"professional. These are all optional — turn on the ones that fit your "
"workflow."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:525
msgid "Show Order Summary Panel"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:526
msgid ""
"Shows a running list of what the customer has chosen so far (e.g. \"Thin "
"Crust + Tomato Sauce + Mozzarella + Pepperoni\"). Helps customers review "
"their choices before confirming."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:528
msgid "Show a summary of selected ingredients"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:534
msgid ""
"Adds a \"Start Over\" button that resets all selections. Useful for "
"customers who want to try a completely different build."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:536
msgid "Show a button to reset all selections"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:541
msgid "Allow Special Instructions"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:542
msgid ""
"Adds a text box where customers can type notes for the kitchen — like \"well "
"done\", \"no salt\", or \"nut allergy\". Useful for accommodating dietary "
"needs."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:544
msgid "Show a \"Special instructions\" text field"
msgstr ""

