msgid ""
"Pops up a final \"review your order\" screen before the customer confirms. "
"Reduces mistakes and gives them one last chance to check everything."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:552
msgid "Show a \"Review your order\" pop-up before confirming"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:558
msgid "Animations"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:561
msgid ""
"Control whether ingredient layers animate when added to the pizza. "
"Animations look great and make the builder feel alive — but you can turn "
"them off if you prefer a simpler, faster feel."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:566
msgid "Layer Animation Style"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:567
msgid ""
"How ingredients appear on the pizza when selected. \"Fade in\" is subtle and "
"clean. \"Drop in\" feels more dramatic. \"Instant\" shows them immediately "
"with no animation."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:570
msgid "Instant — no animation"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:571
msgid "Fade in — smooth and subtle"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:572
msgid "Drop in — falls from above"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:573
msgid "Scale in — grows from small"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:574
msgid "Slide up — enters from below"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:575
msgid "Flip in — 3D rotation reveal"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:581
msgid "Animation Speed"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:582
msgid ""
"How fast the animation plays, in milliseconds. 200ms is quick and snappy. "
"500ms is slower and more dramatic. Most people prefer 250–350ms."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:593
msgid "Accessibility & Performance"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:596
msgid ""
"A few settings that make the builder more usable for everyone — including "
"customers with disabilities — and can help the page load faster. These are "
"safe to leave on their defaults."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:601
msgid "Keyboard Focus Ring Style"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:602
msgid ""
"When someone navigates with a keyboard instead of a mouse, this shows a "
"visible outline around the currently focused item. Important for "
"accessibility and required by some regulations."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:605
msgid "Theme default"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:606
msgid "Bold outline (high visibility)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:607
msgid "Glow ring"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:608
msgid "None (not recommended)"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:614
msgid "Respect \"Reduce Motion\" Setting"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/SettingsWizard.php:615
msgid ""
"Some users turn on \"Reduce Motion\" in their device settings (common for "
"people with vestibular disorders or motion sensitivity). Turning this on "
"respects that preference and disables animations for them."
