#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:148
msgid "What PizzaTier Adds"
msgstr ""

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:149
msgid ""
"PizzaTier is a WooCommerce integration layer for the PizzaTier pizza builder "
"plugin. It bridges the visual pizza builder with the WooCommerce cart, "
"checkout, and order system."
msgstr ""

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:152
msgid "Pizza Product Type"
msgstr "Tipo de producto pizza"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:152
msgid ""
"Adds a custom \"Pizza\" product type to WooCommerce with a dedicated "
"configurator tab in the product editor."
msgstr ""

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:153
msgid ""
"Per-product pricing matrix: set prices by size (rows) and coverage fraction "
"(columns) for precise topping pricing."
msgstr ""
"Matriz de precios por producto: establece precios por tamaño (filas) y "
"fracción de cobertura (columnas) para una fijación precisa de precios de "
"ingredientes."

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:154
msgid "WooCommerce Cart"
msgstr "Carrito de WooCommerce"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:154
msgid ""
"Server-verified add-to-cart with pizza configuration stored as order line-"
"item meta."
msgstr ""
"Añadir al carrito verificado en el servidor con la configuración de pizza "
"almacenada como metadato de línea de pedido."

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:155
msgid "Frontend Builder Embed"
msgstr "Incrustación del configurador en la tienda"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:155
msgid ""
"Automatically injects the PizzaTier builder on pizza product pages with size "
"selector and live price bar."
msgstr ""
"Inyecta automáticamente el configurador de PizzaTier en las páginas de "
"producto pizza con selector de tamaño y barra de precio en tiempo real."

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:156
msgid ""
"Central settings for cart behaviour, display labels, default grid sizes, and "
"more."
msgstr ""

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:157
msgid "Order Detail"
msgstr "Detalle del pedido"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:157
msgid ""
"Pizza size and toppings breakdown stored on every order line item, visible "
"in admin and customer confirmation."
msgstr ""
"Desglose del tamaño y los ingredientes de la pizza almacenado en cada línea "
"de pedido, visible en el administrador y en la confirmación del cliente."

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:160
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Requisitos"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:162
msgid "WordPress 6.0+"
msgstr "WordPress 6.0+"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:163
