msgid ""
"The checkout bar HTML is loaded from the active PizzaTier template folder. "
"To customise it without modifying plugin files, copy the file to your child "
"theme:"
msgstr ""
"El HTML de la barra de pago se carga desde la carpeta de la plantilla activa "
"de PizzaTier. Para personalizarlo sin modificar los archivos del plugin, "
"copia el archivo en tu tema hijo:"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:333
msgid "The Pizza Configurator tab does not appear."
msgstr "La pestaña Configurador de pizza no aparece."

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:334
msgid ""
"Make sure the product type is set to \"Pizza\" in the Product Data dropdown. "
"The tab uses show_if_pizza CSS class so it only appears for pizza products."
msgstr ""

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:337
msgid "The price grid is not visible in the product editor."
msgstr "La tabla de precios no es visible en el editor de productos."

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:338
msgid ""
"The price grid is in the Pizza Configurator tab inside the Product Data "
"metabox. If the metabox is collapsed, click its header to expand it. Also "
"ensure the product type is set to \"Pizza\"."
msgstr ""

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:341
msgid "The builder does not appear on the product page."
msgstr "El configurador no aparece en la página del producto."

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:342
msgid ""
"Check that the Pizza Configurator tab has a PizzaTier template selected and "
"saved. Also verify the builder position in the tab or in Cart & Pricing."
msgstr ""

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:345
msgid "Prices are showing as 0.00."
msgstr "Los precios se muestran como 0,00."

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:346
msgid ""
"The price grid cells need to be filled in for the selected size. If a cell "
"is blank the fallback label is shown. Make sure the size the customer "
"selected has prices in the grid."
msgstr ""
"Las celdas de la tabla de precios deben rellenarse para el tamaño "
"seleccionado. Si una celda está en blanco se muestra la etiqueta de reserva. "
"Asegúrate de que el tamaño seleccionado por el cliente tiene precios en la "
"tabla."

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:349
msgid "Can I use multiple pizza products with different price grids?"
msgstr ""
"¿Puedo usar múltiples productos pizza con diferentes tablas de precios?"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:350
msgid ""
"Yes. The price grid is stored per-product (as post meta). Each pizza product "
"can have completely different sizes, fractions, and prices."
msgstr ""
"Sí. La tabla de precios se almacena por producto (como metadato del post). "
"Cada producto pizza puede tener tamaños, fracciones y precios completamente "
"diferentes."

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:353
msgid "How do I customise the checkout bar appearance?"
msgstr "¿Cómo personalizo la apariencia de la barra de pago?"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:354
msgid ""
"Each PizzaTier template folder contains a checkout-bar.php file. Copy it to "
"your child theme under pizzatier/checkout-bar.php to override the markup, or "
"edit the CSS in PizzaTier's assets/css/frontend.css."
msgstr ""

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:357
msgid "Why does the add-to-cart button show \"Configure your pizza above\"?"
msgstr ""

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Help.php:358
msgid ""
"The JS is waiting for the builder to signal that it is ready. Make sure the "
"PizzaTier shortcode is correctly loading on the page."
msgstr ""
"El JS está esperando que el configurador indique que está listo. Asegúrate "
"de que el shortcode de PizzaTier se carga correctamente en la página."

