"displayed in cart, order admin, and emails."
msgstr ""

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:415
msgid "Note field label"
msgstr "Etiqueta del campo de nota"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:416
msgid "Label shown above the note textarea. Leave blank for default."
