"Display +/− quantity buttons inside the template checkout bar so customers "
"can order multiple of the same custom pizza."
msgstr ""

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:421
msgid "Maximum quantity per pizza"
msgstr ""

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:422
msgid ""
"The highest quantity a customer can order for a single custom pizza. "
"Default: 99."
msgstr ""

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:423
msgid "Append pizza summary to order confirmation"
msgstr "Añadir resumen de pizza a la confirmación de pedido"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:424
msgid ""
"Add a formatted pizza configuration table inside the standard WooCommerce "
"order confirmation email sent to the customer."
msgstr ""
"Añade una tabla con la configuración de la pizza dentro del correo de "
"confirmación de pedido de WooCommerce enviado al cliente."

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:425
msgid "Send a separate pizza summary email"
msgstr "Enviar un correo de resumen de pizza por separado"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:426
msgid ""
"Send a dedicated pizza configuration summary email when the order status "
"becomes \"processing\"."
msgstr ""

