msgstr "Enviar correo separado al cliente"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:428
msgid ""
"Include the customer's billing email as a recipient of the separate pizza "
"summary email."
msgstr ""
"Incluir el correo de facturación del cliente como destinatario del correo de "
"resumen de pizza separado."

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:429
msgid "Send separate email to admin"
msgstr "Enviar correo separado al administrador"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:430
msgid ""
"Also send the separate pizza summary email to the site admin email address."
msgstr ""
"Enviar también el correo de resumen de pizza separado a la dirección de "
"correo del administrador del sitio."

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:431
msgid "Separate email subject"
msgstr "Asunto del correo separado"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:432
msgid ""
"Subject line for the separate pizza summary email. Tokens: {order_number}, "
"{site_name}. Leave blank for default."
msgstr ""
"Asunto del correo de resumen de pizza separado. Tokens: {order_number}, "
"{site_name}. Déjalo en blanco para usar el valor predeterminado."

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:433
msgid "Summary block heading"
msgstr "Encabezado del bloque de resumen"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:434
msgid ""
"Heading text shown above the pizza configuration table in emails. Leave "
"blank for default."
msgstr ""
"Texto del encabezado mostrado encima de la tabla de configuración de pizza "
"en los correos. Déjalo en blanco para usar el valor predeterminado."

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:445 src/Commerce/Admin/SettingsPage.php:39
#: src/PostTypes/PostTypeRegistrar.php:58
msgid "Ingredient Groups"
msgstr "Grupos de ingredientes"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:448
msgid "Enable ingredient grouping"
msgstr "Activar agrupación de ingredientes"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:449
msgid ""
"Assign ingredients (toppings, crusts, sauces, cheeses, drizzles) to "
"hierarchical groups using the \"Ingredient Group\" taxonomy added to each "
"item's edit screen. Groups are passed to the frontend builder so templates "
"can render grouped menus. The base plugin's \"Enable category grouping\" "
"setting is also respected."
msgstr ""

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:459
msgid "How to set up groups"
msgstr "Cómo configurar grupos"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:462
msgid ""
"Edit any topping, crust, sauce, cheese, or drizzle and use the \"Ingredient "
"Group\" meta box to assign it to a group. Groups are hierarchical — create "
"parent groups (e.g. \"Meat\", \"Vegetable\") and optionally sub-groups."
msgstr ""

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:464
msgid "Manage groups →"
msgstr "Gestionar grupos →"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:478
msgid "Tax display on product page"
msgstr "Visualización de impuestos en la página del producto"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:479
msgid "How taxes appear in the live price bar."
msgstr "Cómo se muestran los impuestos en la barra de precio en tiempo real."

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:480
msgid "Inherit from WooCommerce"
msgstr "Heredar de WooCommerce"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:481
msgid "Including tax"
msgstr "Con impuestos"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:482
msgid "Excluding tax"
msgstr "Sin impuestos"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:484
msgid "Tax class override"
msgstr "Sobreescritura de clase de impuesto"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:485
msgid ""
"Force a specific WooCommerce tax class on all pizza products. Leave blank to "
"use each product's own class."
msgstr ""
"Forzar una clase de impuesto de WooCommerce específica en todos los "
"productos pizza. Déjalo en blanco para usar la clase propia de cada producto."

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:486
msgid "Enable REST price endpoint"
msgstr "Activar endpoint REST de precios"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:487
msgid ""
"Expose /wp-json/pizzatier/v1/calculate-price for server-side price "
"verification. Disable only for custom checkout flows."
msgstr ""

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:488
msgid "Disable quantity selector for pizza products"
msgstr "Desactivar el selector de cantidad para productos pizza"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:489
msgid "Force qty=1 — each customisation is its own cart line item."
msgstr ""
"Forzar cantidad=1 — cada personalización es su propia línea en el carrito."

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:490
msgid "Cache price grid data"
msgstr "Cachear datos de la tabla de precios"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:491
msgid ""
"Cache price grid lookups in a transient to reduce database queries on high-"
"traffic stores. Cache is cleared when any grid is saved."
msgstr ""
"Almacena en caché las consultas de la tabla de precios para reducir "
"consultas a la base de datos en tiendas con mucho tráfico. La caché se borra "
"cuando se guarda cualquier tabla."

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:492
msgid "Output product schema markup"
msgstr "Generar marcado de esquema del producto"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:493
msgid ""
"Add JSON-LD schema markup for pizza product pages to help with rich search "
"results."
msgstr ""
"Añadir marcado de esquema JSON-LD en las páginas de producto pizza para "
"mejorar los resultados enriquecidos en buscadores."

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:494
msgid "Live price update delay (ms)"
msgstr "Retraso de actualización de precio en tiempo real (ms)"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:495
msgid ""
"Milliseconds to debounce live price recalculation after a layer change. "
"Default 0 = instant. Increase on slow devices."
msgstr ""
"Milisegundos para el debounce del recálculo de precio en tiempo real tras un "
"cambio de capa. Predeterminado 0 = instantáneo. Auméntalo en dispositivos "
"lentos."

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:496
msgid "Debug mode"
msgstr "Modo de depuración"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:497
msgid ""
"Log price calculation details to the browser console. Disable in production."
msgstr ""
"Registrar los detalles del cálculo de precios en la consola del navegador. "
"Desactívalo en producción."

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:632
msgid "Layout registry unavailable."
msgstr ""

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:641
msgid "Checkout bar layout"
msgstr ""

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:738
msgid "Base price"
msgstr "Precio base"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:745
msgid "Grid cell (per topping/layer)"
msgstr "Celda de tabla (por ingrediente/capa)"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:752
msgid "Number of paid toppings"
msgstr "Número de ingredientes de pago"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:756
msgid "Estimated total"
msgstr "Total estimado"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:759
msgid ""
"Uses the currently saved settings. Save first, then this calculator reflects "
"your actual engine configuration."
msgstr ""
"Usa los ajustes guardados actualmente. Guarda primero y luego esta "
"calculadora reflejará tu configuración real del motor."

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:802
#: src/Commerce/WooCommerce/ProductTab.php:720
msgid "Add-on per layer"
msgstr "Suplemento por capa"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:803
msgid ""
"Each selected layer adds its grid price (Size × Coverage) to the base pizza "
"price. The most flexible and common mode."
msgstr ""
"Cada capa seleccionada añade su precio de tabla (Tamaño × Cobertura) al "
"precio base de la pizza. El modo más flexible y habitual."

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:809
msgid "Flat price per size"
msgstr "Precio fijo por tamaño"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:810
msgid ""
"The grid's \"Whole\" column for the chosen size is a single flat add-on, "
"regardless of how many layers are selected."
msgstr ""

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:816
#: src/Commerce/WooCommerce/ProductTab.php:732
msgid "Highest layer wins"
msgstr "La capa más cara prevalece"

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:817
msgid ""
"Only the most expensive layer's grid price is added. Good for \"any topping, "
"same price\" setups."
msgstr ""

#: src/Commerce/Admin/Settings.php:823
msgid "Tiered by topping count"
msgstr "Por niveles según número de ingredientes"

